{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit a spell, stranger! Come to the little town of Seabreeze for a visual novel filled with love, community, and just a hint of mystery to pull it all together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge map to explore:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/a9da6f47f3a78b265b11f51a43bedff9.avif?t=1772378852\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bet you\u2019re just itching to meet everyone. We have a whole host of fun characters, among them are about 12 women, all of differing personalities, all brought to life through hand-drawn, lovingly made, anime-inspired art! Come meet them and the rest of the cast as the story comes together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge cast of cute characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/04427d09cb5f4ed3c6d199c1de3507f0.poster.avif?t=1772378852\" width=560 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/04427d09cb5f4ed3c6d199c1de3507f0.webm?t=1772378852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/04427d09cb5f4ed3c6d199c1de3507f0.mp4?t=1772378852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does one find these girls? Don\u2019t think too hard about it. Seabreeze ain\u2019t the kind of town that will breathe down your neck to make you find everything. The story you get here is straightforward and simple. If you wanna find the girls, you\u2019ll find them easily enough if you put your ear to the ground. Beyond them, there are quite a fair bit of locations for you to explore. Just keep your nose to the ground though, you never know who or what you might find in a little town like this. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/ebee1dac39813249d393f6c1483c743f.poster.avif?t=1772378852\" width=560 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/ebee1dac39813249d393f6c1483c743f.webm?t=1772378852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/ebee1dac39813249d393f6c1483c743f.mp4?t=1772378852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Ah, you\u2019re wondering more about the ladies here eh? Well, they\u2019re a kindly sort. Most love to meet new people, and each one comes with an interesting host of quirks and needs. Some might help you get jobs, others will need things from you, but all of them are looking for something in life\u2026and who knows, that something might just be you. Careful though\u2026who knows what secrets these girls might be keeping about themselves\u2026or the town itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/d1f0740eb604ce92b55e9d3cbe4ad6a8.poster.avif?t=1772378852\" width=560 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/d1f0740eb604ce92b55e9d3cbe4ad6a8.webm?t=1772378852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/extras/d1f0740eb604ce92b55e9d3cbe4ad6a8.mp4?t=1772378852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 unique, charming and kinky ladies plus other characters.\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very Lite Survival Mechanics!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make decisions about the relationships you make</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become part of the local community and help the townsfolk!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the mystery plaguing the town!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926220?t=1772378852","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926220?t=1772378852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/8331270892949b9c9de4c04d3988feb0b6c6d1d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772378852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926220/8331270892949b9c9de4c04d3988feb0b6c6d1d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772378852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Explicit sexual visuals and dialogue among a casual setting. The full version will include ropeplay, sexual roleplay, religious themes, degradation, breeding, hypnotism, the use of toys and a few other kinks."},"demos":[{"appid":3911850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit a spell, stranger! Come to the little town of Seabreeze for a visual novel filled with love, community, and just a hint of mystery to pull it all together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge map to explore:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto